    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Today we are deciding: Which Skandinavian University to pick for an exchange semester",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Here are the options on the table:",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option A - University of Copenhagen: Strong faculty in humanities; tradeoff: Less emphasis on STEM fields; concern: High living costs in the city; fit: Students interested in history and culture; uncertainty: Language requirements for some courses unclear; best for: Depth-over-breadth learners",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option B - Stockholm University: Diverse range of programs including sustainability studies; tradeoff: Larger class sizes; concern: Integration challenges for international students; fit: Environmentally conscious students; uncertainty: Availability of courses in English variable; best for: Interdisciplinary learners",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option C - University of Oslo: Research opportunities in science and technology; tradeoff: Limited course offerings in social sciences; concern: Weather conditions can be harsh; fit: Students focused on scientific research; uncertainty: Funding opportunities for international students unclear; best for: Specialized knowledge seekers",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option D - Aalto University: Innovative approach to education with a focus on entrepreneurship; tradeoff: Less traditional academic structure; concern: High expectations for student projects; fit: Students looking for practical, real-world experience; uncertainty: International recognition of degrees uncertain; best for: Hands-on learners",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "What are your top priorities for an exchange semester - academic focus, cultural immersion, research opportunities, or practical experience?",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 1,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Lena",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Hey, I'm really hoping for a place with strong English support",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1355,
      "tokens_out": 14
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 2,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Kasper",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Hi, affordability is key for me, considering cost of living impacts student experience",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1420,
      "tokens_out": 16
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 3,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Astrid",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Hi, hoping for a place with strong interdisciplinary research opportunities",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1386,
      "tokens_out": 12
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 4,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Kasper",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "What's the language support like at the University of Oslo?",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1610,
      "tokens_out": 13
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 5,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Lena",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Not sure about Oslo's language support, but I know Stockholm University has great resources for international students.",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1536,
      "tokens_out": 21
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 6,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Astrid",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "How important is cost of living to everyone?",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1497,
      "tokens_out": 10
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 7,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Lena",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Cost of living is a concern, but for me, English support comes first.",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1487,
      "tokens_out": 17
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 8,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Kasper",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Cost of living is a big deal, Astrid, it affects student experience and stress levels, so it's a top consideration for me.",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1493,
      "tokens_out": 29
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 9,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Lena",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "I still prefer Stockholm, but I can live with Aalto if they guarantee strong English support.",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1544,
      "tokens_out": 20
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 10,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Kasper",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "What about scholarships, can we look into which universities offer the most financial aid to international students?",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 1552,
